          "id": 2,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "This dashboard requires hw-health to be configured with bmc latency metrics enabled.\nThe setting is\n\n```toml\n[metrics]\nenable_bmc_latency_metrics = true\n```\n\n`bmc_latency_attributes` can be configured to reduce the amount of data emitted.\n\nIf environment variables are used to configure NICo health, the following setting can be used:\n```\nCARBIDE_HEALTH__METRICS__ENABLE_BMC_LATENCY_METRICS: \"true\"\n```",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "title": "Requirements",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Usage",
      "type": "row"
    },
